   "lines": [
    "Went out to Oyster",
    "Bay; Russell, Haddon,",
    "Betts, Maud Elliott",
    "& the two Miss Kanes",
    "are passing Sunday",
    "with us. I was",
    "perfectly delighted",
    "to see all the",
    "family again;",
    "Muffie & the two",
    "darling girls",
    "greeted me so lovingly.",
    "I spent the whole",
    "day talking with",
    "them all. All the",
    "\"Roosevelt boys\"",
    "are out here.",
    "Aunt Lucy & Maud",
    "Elliott are staying with us."
   ],
